From 81e5e3a0369c2e9d8815f34316d0ef1dffd577ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mateus Seiboth <mateusseiboth@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 00:15:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sc7280: xiaomi-lisa: add the main
 and front cameras

New drivers for the Samsung S5KGW3 (main, 4640x3472 and 4640x2612) and
S5K3T2 (front, 2592x1940) sensors, with register tables from the stock
sensor module data, and the device tree nodes for both. The front
camera supplies are fixed regulators switched by GPIO, as in the stock
device tree.
---
